On 8/26/05, Ben Goertzel <ben@goertzel.org> wrote:
> Based on the issue with terminators (zei doesn't have one),
> I have now reverted to qui instead of zei in the latest edit

{zei} actually fits better with your underscore: 
la white_house -> la white zei house

For sense disambiguation, a subindex with {xi} would be 
better. The only problem is that {xi} only takes a number 
or a MEX, so to use a brivla/English word you need to 
go through some conversions:

   set xi vei ni'e traditional math ve'o

mu'o mi'e xorxes


